    "notes": "Kokoro am_onyx, free (IN-FOR-BEAR LAW). GATE P before any ElevenLabs swap. Six GitHub skin scenes in fixed order: RepoHero, StructureMap, CallChain, Churn, CodeViewer, CodeDiff. Four Manim beats: B09 LOC hotspot, B23 vocab partition, B27 logit bars, B31 binomial null. Three CodeViewer slices: Slice A L62-80, Slice B L95-117, Slice C L153-164. Slice A range shortened from PLAN L54-80: L61 (assert, 135 chars) overflows the type floor; range starts at L62 to avoid elision. Slice B range shortened from L94-117: L94 (_bias_greenlist_logits def, 128 chars) overflows; range starts at L95. Lines L74, L78 (Slice A), L98, L113, L115 (Slice B) may clip at right edge at 26px mono \u2014 bytes in props are verbatim, display clipping is logged. KGW prohibition: no beat states or implies Anthropic's algorithm is this code. Never publish.",
